========================================================================
  Welcome to KryX Linux Live (x86_64)
========================================================================
  Package manager : kpm   (config: /etc/kpm.ini, key: /etc/kpm/keys/kryx-release.pub)
  Ports sync      : ports (built into kpm)
  Handbook (CLI)  : curl -s https://kryx.anrix.org/install.txt | less

  Quick install steps:
    1. Partition & mount target root at /mnt (and EFI at /mnt/boot/efi):
         lsblk && cfdisk /dev/<disk>
         mkfs.ext4 /dev/<root-part> && mount /dev/<root-part> /mnt
    2. Install base KryX Linux via kpm:
         setup
    3. Chroot to configure /etc/fstab, GRUB, and root password:
         setup-chroot /mnt
========================================================================
